@startuml hu-22-state-reward-workflow
title HU-22 — Estados de RewardWorkflow (por participante HUMAN de una batalla)

[*] --> PENDING_CREDIT : BattleResult terminal (HU-21)

PENDING_CREDIT --> CREDIT_CONFIRMED : Wallet responde (applied true o false por replay)
PENDING_CREDIT --> RETRYABLE_FAILURE : timeout / 503

CREDIT_CONFIRMED --> COMPLETED : chestEarned == false
CREDIT_CONFIRMED --> CHEST_ELIGIBLE : chestEarned == true

CHEST_ELIGIBLE --> REWARD_SELECTED : RandomSequencePort.nextIndex() (HU-24)\ny persistencia del productId

REWARD_SELECTED --> INVENTORY_PENDING : POST Player-Inventory grants
INVENTORY_PENDING --> COMPLETED : Inventory confirma (applied)
INVENTORY_PENDING --> RETRYABLE_FAILURE : timeout / 503\n(reintenta MISMO productId, no vuelve a sortear)
INVENTORY_PENDING --> TERMINAL_FAILURE : 422 (productId ya no válido en Catalog)

RETRYABLE_FAILURE --> PENDING_CREDIT : reintento (si falló antes de CREDIT_CONFIRMED)
RETRYABLE_FAILURE --> REWARD_SELECTED : reintento (si falló después de REWARD_SELECTED)

COMPLETED --> [*]
TERMINAL_FAILURE --> [*] : requiere intervención;\ncréditos ya confirmados quedan firmes

note right of TERMINAL_FAILURE
  No revierte el crédito ya acreditado
  por Wallet (HU-22 §66). Web muestra
  rewardDelivery: PENDING, nunca
  "entregado" en falso.
end note

@enduml
